      "repair_reason": "- [P1] Human review is needed because the contributor still needs real behavior proof and maintainers should choose one canonical fix among overlapping open PRs.; Cleared: The diff only changes TypeScript error-message branching and focused tests; it adds no dependencies, permissions, network calls, secrets handling, or package execution paths. (sha=ea3dd1b3bf3c5e3cd7aae069fcd5f64dc6188511)",
      "review_summary": "The branch adds a legacy `openai-codex` branch to the embedded-agent missing-model hint helper and regression tests for legacy, bundled, and custom provider hint text.\n\nPR surface: Source +8, Tests +42. Total +50 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main still emits the generic provider-registration hint for unresolved configured `openai-codex` model refs, and current validation rejects the reported `models.providers.openai-codex` overlay without `baseUrl`. I did not run a live Docker crash-loop reproduction in this read-only review.",
